<h2>Use trends to help you reflect</h2>
<p><strong>A chart can show a change. It can't tell you the cause.</strong></p>
<p>HRV can change along with exercise, illness, alcohol, medicines, sleep or how a reading was taken. A chart can't single out the cause, or prove that a supplement or other change worked.</p>
<p>Pair your readings with a <a href="/resources/stress-sleep-journal/">stress and sleep journal</a>. Talk to a clinician about any symptoms that worry you.</p>

